{"id": "B-STATE-025", "scope": "switch", "slice": 3, "module": ":engine:runtime", "decision": "02 §3.3 rule 5, D6", "amended": "After a restart or crash, the recovery report waits for an authenticated health answer before claiming recovery; a process with no answering server is never recovered; missing credentials do not probe or claim recovery; stopped and uninstalled servers are distinct and never probed; remote and deleted profiles are not checked; unknown historical services block an everything-is-back claim; normal launch, update, or no previously running services show no notice.", "amended_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "review-C: Recovery of the phone server is runtime (S3); :engine:diagnostics is not owned in S3; AI Team/Gas City recovery and Termux clauses dropped"}
